<section id="tasks" class="page hidden"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">One thing at a time</span><h2>My list</h2><p>Add an optional date to help you plan ahead.</p></div></div><div class="card"><h3>Things to remember</h3><form id="taskForm" class="row"><input id="taskInput" aria-label="Add an item" placeholder="What would you like to remember?" maxlength="120" required><label class="date-label">Due date <input id="taskDate" type="date" aria-label="Optional due date"></label><button class="button">Add</button></form><p id="taskMessage" role="status"></p><label for="taskFilter">Show: </label><select id="taskFilter"><option value="all">All items</option><option value="open">To do</option><option value="done">Completed</option></select><div id="taskList" aria-live="polite"></div><p class="muted">Check an item when it’s done. Dates do not send alerts. Your list is saved to your account.</p></div></section>
